    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="58.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 58.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hwa leodbisceopes oððe ealdormannes borh abrece, gebete mid twam pundum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone violates the protection of the bishop of a diocese or of an ealdorman, he shall pay £2 as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa leodbisceopes oððe ealdormannes borh abrece, gebete þæt mid II pundan.</ab>
      </div>
